{"seq":74,"slug":"rust-systems-programming","title":"Rust 系统编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"rust-系统编程\">Rust 系统编程</h1><p>Rust 正在重新定义系统编程的边界。2026 年，Rust 在 Linux 7.0 内核中从实验状态毕业为稳定特性，io_uring 异步运行时在高性能网络中成为主流选择，Embassy 框架让嵌入式异步开发进入生产阶段。这些进展标志着 Rust 已经不再是系统编程的「另一种选择」，而是正在成为新的事实标准。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于 Rust 在系统编程领域的深度实践。与同类目下的「Rust 语言」hub 不同——后者覆盖语言本身的所有权、类型系统、并发原语等基础知识——本 hub 假设读者已掌握 Rust 语法和核心概念，专注于操作系统交互、内核开发、异步运行时内部机制、嵌入式裸机编程等系统层面的工程实践。如果你在阅读中遇到所有权或生命周期的基础疑问，建议先回到 Rust 语言 hub 巩固。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径因背景而异。对于具有 C/C++ 系统编程经验、正在考虑将项目迁移到 Rust 的开发者，建议按「基础篇 → 系统篇 → 实践篇」的顺序阅读，嵌入式篇可按需选读。对于嵌入式背景的开发者，可直接从「基础篇」跳到「嵌入式篇」，再回读系统篇中的异步运行时章节以理解 Embassy 的底层机制。对于纯 Rust 背景但缺少系统编程经验的开发者，建议完整按章节顺序学习，每章的代码示例都经过精心设计以展示真实的系统级模式。</p>\n<p>前置知识：熟悉 Rust 基本语法（所有权、借用、生命周期、trait），了解操作系统基本概念（进程、线程、系统调用、虚拟内存），有 Linux 使用经验。不要求有内核开发或嵌入式经验——这正是本 hub 要教授的内容。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"系统编程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ownership-and-unsafe","title":"所有权边界与 unsafe 系统编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations/ownership-and-unsafe"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-layout-control","title":"内存布局精确控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations/memory-layout-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-cost-abstractions","title":"零成本抽象的编译器实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations/zero-cost-abstractions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"systems","title":"系统级异步与内核开发","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"io-uring-async","title":"io_uring 与完成式异步模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems/io-uring-async"},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-runtime-internals","title":"异步运行时内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems/async-runtime-internals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rust-for-linux-kernel","title":"Rust for Linux 内核模块开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems/rust-for-linux-kernel"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"embedded","title":"嵌入式与裸机编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"no-std-fundamentals","title":"no_std 环境与裸机编程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/no-std-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"embassy-async-embedded","title":"Embassy 异步嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/embassy-async-embedded"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hardware-abstraction","title":"硬件抽象层与 embedded-hal 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/hardware-abstraction"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"系统编程实战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lock-free-data-structures","title":"无锁数据结构实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/lock-free-data-structures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ffi-and-c-interop","title":"FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/ffi-and-c-interop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-profiling","title":"系统级性能分析与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/performance-profiling"}]}]}